# FFX provider modules are runtime-only and pinned in the consuming
# application's private Git LFS tree (BARD), not in this public fork: GitHub
# forbids new LFS objects on public forks, and an OSS PR must stay pure source.
# Keep a local copy under native/<target>/ffx/ for offline probes; it is never
# committed here. See native/README.md.

